sentences.text:
The writ petition was filed seeking the following reliefs:
"a) issue a writ of mandamus or any other appropriate writ, order or direction directing the 3rd respondent not to construct a bus stop along the eastern boundary of the petitioner's property blocking its entrance;
Mrs. Ramya Bijoy vs Irinjalakuda Municipality on 2 February, 2026 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/110888024/

2 b) issue a writ of mandamus or any other appropriate writ, order or direction to the 3 rd respondent to consider Exhibit P4 representation before proceeding with the finalisation of the site for the bus stop or the shifting of the location of the existing bus stop at Mapranam junction along the western side of the Thrissur-Irinjalakuda state PWD road;
c) to dispense with the filing of a translation of vernacular documents;
d) issue such other order or orders as this honourable court may deem fit and proper in the facts and circumstances of the case."
2. Petitioners claim to be the owners of 8.10 Ares of property situated in Survey Nos.1069/11-8,
1069/10-3, 1069/11-7 and 1069/10-2 of Madayikkonam Village, Thrissur District.
